        "type": "object",
        "description": "The anonymous submit body.\n\n``version_id`` is what the client echoes back from the schema it\nrendered — it is what makes a racing publish a clean 409 instead of a\nsilent mis-validation. ``captcha_token`` is the seam the pair fills:\nthe netintel tier decides whether a token is required at all, so it\nstays optional here and the captcha layer refuses on its own terms.",
